$DATUM N-(3,4-Dimethoxy-benzyl)-N-(2-piperidin-3-yl-ethyl)-isophthalamide (24).
Isophthalic acid monomethyl ester (180.2 mg, 1.0 mmol) and
3,4-dimethoxybenzylamine (0.167 mL, 1.1 mmol) were coupled using the
standard procedure with NMM to provide
N-(3,4-dimethoxy-benzyl)-isophthalamic acid methyl ester (350 mg, 98%
yield). ESMS: m/z 330 (M + H). HPLC: 95%, which was used directly.
