3H), 3.74 (t, J = 5.7 Hz, 2H), 3.59 (s, 2H), 2.37 (s, 3H), 1.80–1.73 (m,
2H). 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 168.3, 168.2, 156.0, 139.3, 136.3, 133.4,
131.1, 130.7, 130.2, 129.0, 114.9, 111.7, 101.1, 74.5, 59.4, 55.6, 30.4,
