$DATUM Arumugasamy, Jeevanandam; Arunachalam, Kannan; Bauer, David; Becker,
Alan; Caillet, Catherine A.; Glynn, Roberta; Latham, G. Mark; Lim,
Jinsoo; Liu, Jia; Mayes, Benjamin A.; Moussa, Adel; Rosinovsky, Elodie;
Salanson, Aurelien E.; Soret, Adrien F.; Stewart, Alistair; Wang,
Jingyang; Wu, Xinghua
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Process Research & Development (2013), 17(5), 811-828

